 per-sample snap; leave #4107's decision file alone

The decision file rule is one PR, one file: the #4180 update line in
4107-marching-node-snap.md is dropped (4180-snap-per-sample.md cites #4107).
The either-end corner test calls tet directly, which no longer snaps; its
name and comment now say it checks the interpolated corner from either end.

Refs #4180

